<h3>Show Me What I Am Playing</h3>
<p>Sometimes the dots contain information inside them: note names, interval=
s, or fingerings. &nbsp; You still play them like you would play the dots, =
but these diagrams give additional information for the guitarist who is rea=
ding the notation.</p>
